   \[
   A_{\text{border}} = A_{\text{outer}} - A_{\text{picture}} = 48 - 35 = 13 \text{ square inches}
   \]

### Final Answer
The area of the visible red border is given by:
\[
\boxed{13} \text{ square inches}
\]

