t_{12} & = t_{10} + t_{11} = 6 + 5 = 4, \\
t_{13} & = t_{11} + t_{12} = 5 + 4 = 2, \\
t_{14} & = t_{12} + t_{13} = 4 + 2 = 6, \\
t_{15} & = t_{13} + t_{14} = 2 + 6 = 1.
\end{align*}
\]

Continuing this process, we find that the Fibonacci numbers modulo \( 7 \) repeat every \( 16 \) terms:
\[
\begin{align*}
t_0 & \equiv 0, \\
t_1 & \equiv 1, \\
t_2 & \equiv 1, \\
t_3 & \equiv 2, \\
t_4 & \equiv 3, \\
t_5 & \equiv 5, \\
t_6 & \equiv 1, \\
