- \( b \equiv 10 \pmod{16} \) implies \( t_b \equiv t_{10} \equiv 6 \).
- \( c \equiv 15 \pmod{16} \) implies \( t_c \equiv t_{15} \equiv 1 \).

#### Step 3: Calculate \( t_a + t_b + t_c \)
Now we compute:
\[
