\]
for some scalar \( m \).

### Step 2: Mathematical Concepts Involved
Collinearity of vectors means that one vector can be expressed as a linear combination of the others. In this case, we will express \( \mathbf{w} \) as a linear combination of \( \mathbf{u} \) and \( \mathbf{v} \).

